Audrey Fleurot's bailing on us.

406
00:19:10,685 --> 00:19:11,805
Merde.
Shit.

407
00:19:12,165 --> 00:19:13,445
T'as essayé de lui passer un savon ?
Did you try bawling her out?

408
00:19:13,525 --> 00:19:16,125
C'est ce qu'il faut faire. C'est le seul langage qu'ils comprennent.
That's what you have to do.
That's all they understand.

409
00:19:23,205 --> 00:19:24,365
Ça va ?
How's it going?

410
00:19:24,445 --> 00:19:27,125
Bien. Flora voulait te raconter sa journée.
Good. Flora wanted to tell you
about her day.

411
00:19:27,205 --> 00:19:28,965
Ah, qu'est-ce qu'elle a fait ?
Oh, what did she do?

412
00:19:29,685 --> 00:19:30,765
Andréa.
Andréa.

413
00:19:31,325 --> 00:19:33,685
C'est vrai, le premier jour à la crèche ! Comment ça s'est passé ?
Right, the first day at daycare!
How was it?

414
00:19:33,765 --> 00:19:36,365
Très bien. Elle sait lire maintenant.
Very productive.
She knows how to read now.

415
00:19:38,525 --> 00:19:40,565
Désolé, c'est la folie ici.
I'm sorry, things are crazy around here.

416
00:19:41,125 --> 00:19:42,045
Ouais, comme d'habitude.
Yeah, as usual.

417
00:19:43,845 --> 00:19:46,405
Si on allait dîner en amoureux demain soir ?
How about we go out
for a romantic dinner tomorrow night?

418
00:19:47,045 --> 00:19:47,965
