What about the baby?

419
00:19:48,045 --> 00:19:50,085
On va faire comme tous les autres parents.
We'll do what all the other parents do.

420
00:19:50,165 --> 00:19:51,645
On va appeler une baby-sitter.
We'll call a baby-sitter.

421
00:19:53,205 --> 00:19:55,805
On va attendre qu'elle ait 18 ans pour aller boire un verre ?
Are we going to wait
until she's 18 to go out for a drink?

422
00:19:57,125 --> 00:19:58,365
Ok, t'as raison.
Okay, you're right.

423
00:19:58,885 --> 00:20:00,125
Je vais trouver quelqu'un.
I'll find someone.

424
00:20:00,725 --> 00:20:02,845
Super ! Je t'aime.
Cool! I love you.

425
00:20:02,925 --> 00:20:03,885
Moi aussi je t'aime.
I love you too.

426
00:20:08,165 --> 00:20:09,765
Ce parfum est absolument incroyable.
This flavor is just amazing.

427
00:20:11,165 --> 00:20:12,165
J'ai prévenu les voisins.
I told the neighbors.

428
