Mais tu oublies quelque chose.
But you're forgetting something.

442
00:20:44,405 --> 00:20:47,125
Tu vas devenir héritière de l'empire Barneville.
You'll become a heiress
to the Barneville empire.

443
00:20:47,325 --> 00:20:48,525
Non, vraiment, je te jure.
No, really, I swear.

444
00:20:49,085 --> 00:20:53,245
C'est pas rien. Hicham a racheté les parts de ton père pour genre dix milliards.
That's no small matter. Hicham bought out
your father's shares for like ten billion.

445
00:20:53,325 --> 00:20:54,645
Oui, au moins !
Yes, sure. At least!

446
00:20:54,725 --> 00:20:56,205
C'est ça. Je suis sérieux !
That's right. I mean it!

447
00:20:56,285 --> 00:20:58,405
Imagine, on pourrait se prendre un appartement immense.
Picture it, we could get a huge apartment.

448
00:20:58,485 --> 00:21:00,285
Allez, Camille, ouvre les yeux !
Come on, Camille, open your eyes!

449
00:21:08,485 --> 00:21:09,445
Pardon, excusez-moi.
I'm sorry, excuse me.

450
00:21:09,525 --> 00:21:11,725
-Je peux commander un autre café ? -Bien sûr.
-Can I order another coffee?
-Of course.

451
