Vous avez vu Nathalie Baye ?
Have you seen Nathalie Baye?

452
00:21:13,765 --> 00:21:15,005
-Nathalie Baye ? -Ouais.
-Nathalie Baye?
-Yeah.

453
00:21:15,565 --> 00:21:19,005
-Non, mais Catherine Deneuve est là-bas. -Vraiment ? Où ça ?
-No, but Catherine Deneuve is over there.
-Really? Where?

454
00:21:19,605 --> 00:21:20,445
Je plaisante !
I'm joking!

455
00:21:21,845 --> 00:21:22,685
Super.
Great.

456
00:21:31,525 --> 00:21:32,765
-Excusez-moi. -Attention.
-Excuse me.
-Careful.

457
00:21:32,845 --> 00:21:35,645
Nathalie, vous tournez demain, et je ne suis pas sûr
Nathalie, you're shooting tomorrow,
and I'm not sure

458
00:21:35,725 --> 00:21:38,445
que l'assurance couvre les accidents de plateau.
the insurance covers file accidents.

459
00:21:38,525 --> 00:21:39,565
Bien, d'accord.
Okay, good.

460
00:21:39,645 --> 00:21:40,965
Antoine, bonjour !
Antoine, hello!

461
00:21:41,045 --> 00:21:42,605
Désolé, Mathias, une seconde.
Sorry, Mathias, just a second.

462
00:21:42,685 --> 00:21:46,165
Les coursiers se mettent le long du comptoir. Vous bloquez le passage.
