You're blocking the way.

463
00:21:51,085 --> 00:21:51,925
Nathalie ?
Nathalie?

464
00:21:52,005 --> 00:21:53,365
Vous n'êtes pas avec Andréa ?
You're not with Andréa?

465
00:21:53,445 --> 00:21:54,805
On devait se retrouver ici.
We were supposed to meet here.

466
00:21:54,885 --> 00:21:58,765
Oui, j'ai suggéré à Andréa que la réunion ait lieu à l'agence.
Yes, I suggested to Andréa
that the meeting take place at the agency.

467
00:21:59,885 --> 00:22:01,685
On ne s'entend pas parler dans les cafés.
You can't hear yourself speak in cafés.

468
00:22:01,765 --> 00:22:03,325
Ici non plus, d'ailleurs.
Here neither, actually.

469
00:22:03,405 --> 00:22:04,245
Excusez-moi.
Excuse me.

470
00:22:04,765 --> 00:22:06,925
-Oui. C'est assez animé. -Un café ?
-Yes. It's pretty animated.
-Coffee?

471
00:22:07,685 --> 00:22:10,085
Non, bien sûr qu'il ne m'a pas prévenu !
No, of course he didn't warn me!

472
00:22:10,165 --> 00:22:11,245
Le salaud.
The bastard.

473
00:22:11,325 --> 00:22:14,205
Faites ce que vous avez à faire, mais Nathalie Baye ne va pas plus loin
Do what you have to do,
but Nathalie Baye does not walk further

474
00:22:14,285 --> 00:22:15,805
-que l'accueil ! -Votre café !
-than reception!
-Your coffee!

475
00:22:15,885 --> 00:22:17,365
Donnez-le à Catherine Deneuve !
Give it to Catherine Deneuve!

476
