877
00:41:39,045 --> 00:41:41,205
Et puis y'a une leçon importante ici aussi.
And then there's
an important lesson here too.

878
00:41:41,845 --> 00:41:44,365
C'est très, très important.
This is very, very important.

879
00:41:45,085 --> 00:41:49,245
Ça va te guider toute ta carrière. Si quelqu'un te demande de le frapper,
It will guide you throughout your career.
If someone asks you to punch them,

880
00:41:49,325 --> 00:41:50,285
fais-le pas.
don't do it.

881
00:41:50,845 --> 00:41:52,365
