tell her she'll be getting a nice contract
for the movie with Luchini.

901
00:42:40,085 --> 00:42:42,325
Super ! Tu as réussi à contrer Mathias ?
Cool! You managed to counter Mathias?

902
00:42:43,485 --> 00:42:46,445
J'ai hâte de voir sa tête quand il apprendra qu'on garde Boon.
Can't wait to see his face
when he learns that we're keeping Boon.

903
00:42:48,805 --> 00:42:50,405
-Très bien. Bonne soirée. -Au revoir.
