-Bye.

904
00:42:56,005 --> 00:42:57,285
À demain, Justine.
See you tomorrow, Justine.

905
00:42:57,805 --> 00:42:58,685
À demain.
See you tomorrow.

906
00:42:59,245 --> 00:43:00,765
À demain !
See you tomorrow!

907
00:43:01,245 --> 00:43:03,325
Hé, calme-toi, ok ? Arrête de m'agresser !
Hey, chill, Okay? Stop attacking me!

908
00:43:03,405 --> 00:43:05,165
Attends, c'est moi qui t'agresse ?
Wait, hold on, I'm attacking you?

909
00:43:05,245 --> 00:43:07,765
