911
00:43:10,965 --> 00:43:12,285
Tu as pris la place de Cécile.
You took Cécile's place.

912
00:43:12,365 --> 00:43:15,245
N'importe quoi, je n'ai pas pris la place de Cécile.
Bullshit, I didn't take Cécile's place.

913
00:43:16,045 --> 00:43:17,085
C'est qui, Cécile ?
Who's Cécile?

914
00:43:17,165 --> 00:43:19,085
C'était l'assistante du producteur précédent.
She was the previous producer's assistant.

915
00:43:19,165 --> 00:43:20,765
Barneville l'a fait virer.
Barneville had her fired.

916
00:43:20,845 --> 00:43:22,725
On s'est tous dit : « C'est comme ça.
We all thought: "That's how it goes.

917
00:43:22,805 --> 00:43:24,565
Il a sa propre assistante. »
He has his own assistant."

918
00:43:25,125 --> 00:43:27,325
Mais toi tu as couché pour avoir le poste, c'est différent.
But you slept to get the job,
so it's different.

