929
00:43:57,005 --> 00:43:58,205
-Ouais. -Bonsoir !
-Yeah.
-Good evening!

930
00:43:59,365 --> 00:44:01,445
Voilà. Alors, on y est.
There. So, here we are.

931
00:44:02,165 --> 00:44:03,005
