Pour parler du film de Djamila et ensuite...
To talk about Djamila's movie and then...

939
00:44:17,125 --> 00:44:18,805
on partagerait la couverture.
we'd share the cover.

940
00:44:20,645 --> 00:44:22,005
Bonne idée, non ?
Good idea, right?

941
00:44:22,085 --> 00:44:24,645
Oui. C'est... C'est vraiment une super idée...
Yes. It's... It's a great idea, really...

942
00:44:25,565 --> 00:44:27,485
Mais avec tout ce qui s'est passé...
But with everything that went on...

943
00:44:27,565 --> 00:44:28,925
On a changé nos plans.
We changed our plans.

944
00:44:29,005 --> 00:44:31,085
On va faire la couverture avec quelqu'un d'autre.
We're going to do the cover
on someone else.

945
00:44:31,165 --> 00:44:32,005
Je suis désolé.
I'm sorry.

946
00:44:32,085 --> 00:44:34,285
Qui d'autre que Dylan et Franck ?
Who other than Dylan and Franck?

947
