Tony Parker n'a pas besoin d'être présenté.
No need to introduce Tony Parker.

952
00:44:46,525 --> 00:44:49,285
Tony, je suis ravi de vous accueillir.
Tony, I'm delighted to have you here.

953
00:44:49,365 --> 00:44:51,285
-Vous connaissez Franck Dubosc. -Bien sûr.
-You know Franck Dubosc.
-Of course.

954
00:44:51,365 --> 00:44:53,365
-Bonjour. -Dylan...
-Hello.
-Dylan...

955
00:44:53,445 --> 00:44:54,525
-Salut. -Et...
-Hi.
-And...

956
00:44:55,085 --> 00:44:57,605
-Oui, Gabriel... Sarda. -Bonjour.
-Yes, Gabriel... Sarda.
-Hello.

957
00:44:57,685 --> 00:45:00,285
Tony va jouer dans Othello de Shakespeare.
Tony is going to be playing
in Shakespeare's Othello.

958
00:45:00,365 --> 00:45:01,965
-C'est formidable. -Vous viendrez ?
-That's wonderful.
-Will you come?

959
00:45:02,485 --> 00:45:03,685
-Oui, avec plaisir. -Bien sûr.
-Yes, totally.
-Of course.

960
00:45:03,765 --> 00:45:05,845
Franck, on peut faire un selfie ensemble ?
Franck, could we get a selfie together?

961
00:45:05,925 --> 00:45:07,365
-Oui. -Ma mère est...
-Yes.
-My mother is...

962
00:45:07,445 --> 00:45:08,485
une grande fan.
a big fan.

963
00:45:14,085 --> 00:45:15,445
-Merci. -On y va, Tony.
-Thanks.
-Let's go, Tony.

964
00:45:16,205 --> 00:45:17,525
À bientôt, Patrick.
See you around, Patrick.

965
00:45:24,245 --> 00:45:25,565
J'aurais dû l'inviter ?
Should I have invited her?

966
00:45:26,565 --> 00:45:29,405
C'est ta boss, c'est normal de ne pas vouloir d'elle à ta fête.
She's your boss, it's normal
not to want her at your party.

967
00:45:29,885 --> 00:45:31,245
Ouais, ça me semble sain.
Yeah, it sounds healthy to me.

968
00:45:32,485 --> 00:45:35,045
Oui, ne sois pas fâché mais je n'ai pas invité Mathias non plus.
Yes, don't be mad
but I didn't invite Mathias either.

969
