Entrez !
Come in!

975
00:45:51,645 --> 00:45:53,405
-Salut tout le monde. -Bienvenue !
-Hey, everyone.
-Welcome!

976
00:45:54,045 --> 00:45:55,765
-Oh, sympa. -Bonjour.
-Oh, cool.
-Hello.

977
00:45:55,845 --> 00:45:57,925
-Ça va ? -Très bien.
-How's it going?
-Great.

978
00:45:58,005 --> 00:45:59,725
Vous avez rencontré Sarah ?
You've met Sarah?

979
00:45:59,805 --> 00:46:01,325
-Sarah, Noémie. -Enchantée.
-Sarah, Noémie.
-Nice to meet you.

980
00:46:01,405 --> 00:46:03,085
-Tu as apporté du champagne ? -Oui.
-Did you bring champagne?
-Yes, I did.

981
00:46:03,165 --> 00:46:05,645
-Et Sarah a dévalisé un magasin. -Un magasin de perruques.
-And Sarah robbed a store.
-A wig store.

982
00:46:08,005 --> 00:46:09,765
C'est quoi une fête sans perruques ?
What's a party without wigs?

983
00:46:10,805 --> 00:46:13,005
Merci, Sarah !
Thanks, Sarah!

984
00:46:25,045 --> 00:46:28,045
Camille t'a dit ? J'ai eu la confirmation pour le film avec Luchini.
Did Camille tell you? I got confirmation
for the film with Luchini.

985
00:46:28,645 --> 00:46:30,285
-Vraiment ? -Ouais.
-Really?
-Yeah.

986
00:46:30,365 --> 00:46:33,005
-Cool, non ? -Félicitations. Je suis tellement contente.
-Cool, right?
-Congratulations. I'm so happy.

987
00:46:33,085 --> 00:46:34,965
C'est pas François Ozon qui réalise ?
Isn't François Ozon. directing?

988
00:46:35,045 --> 00:46:36,565
-Si, si, c'est lui. -Ouais.
-Yeah, yeah, he is.
-Yeah.

989
00:46:36,645 --> 00:46:38,125
Enfin, un jour sur deux, hein ?
Well, every other day, right?

990
00:46:38,685 --> 00:46:40,605
-Quoi ? -Oh, ils t'ont pas dit ?
-What?
-Oh, didn't they tell you?

991
00:46:40,685 --> 00:46:41,685
Non. Non, non.
No. No, no.

992
00:46:41,765 --> 00:46:44,205
Ouais, François Ozon a un frère jumeau.
Yeah, François Ozon has a twin brother.

993
00:46:44,285 --> 00:46:46,205
Gilles Ozon.
Gilles Ozon.

994
00:46:46,285 --> 00:46:49,365
C'est un peu comme les Dardenne, sauf que
They're kind of like the Dardennes,
except that

995
00:46:49,445 --> 00:46:53,245
